# Build-context filter for Dockerfile.zeroclaw (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# in place of the context's own .dockerignore). The image only packages artifacts
# built on the host by stack/build_zeroclaw.sh, and upstream ZeroClaw's .dockerignore
# excludes exactly those (target/, web/dist, *.png, *.svg), so admit just them.
*
!target/release-fast/zeroclaw
!web/dist
!web/dist/**
